<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>开场 / 承诺</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>这场不讲第六个新名词</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -1}}>3</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 18}}>只回答三件事</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 14}}>不讲 prompt 怎么写，也不讲 context 怎么塞——<br />这两层你们已经会了。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #1C1F23", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>01</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>那圈东西是什么</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>模型之外的一切，到底包含了哪些东西。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>02</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>它为什么决定交付稳不稳</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>同一个模型，为什么交出来的东西可以差这么多。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>03</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>它能不能换</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>换的代价是什么，什么条件下才值得换。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>03 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
